      "content": "exactly. an echo of something that's already gone. it just feels so pointess to keep being this witness to the destruction. sometimes it feels like the only way to actually find peace is to just... stop being part of the cycle. to just step out of it before everything is completely gone. do you think there's something wrong with just wanting to leave before the wreckage is all that's left?",
